WEBVTT

00:13:59.926 --> 00:14:03.311
"It was my friends and my colleagues

00:14:03.335 --> 00:14:04.671
who kept me going."

00:14:05.173 --> 00:14:10.488
One added, "It was pretty much
the opposite of the gig economy."

00:14:12.056 --> 00:14:15.790
But then I went and I talked to a group
of young, rising executives,

00:14:15.814 --> 00:14:17.621
and I asked them,

00:14:17.645 --> 00:14:19.187
"Who are your friends at work?"

00:14:19.211 --> 00:14:20.989
And they just looked blank.

00:14:21.765 --> 00:14:23.615
"There's no time."

00:14:23.639 --> 00:14:25.448
"They're too busy."

00:14:25.472 --> 00:14:26.910
"It's not efficient."

00:14:27.906 --> 00:14:31.478
Who, I wondered, is going to give them